n让树脂诉说沧桑。\n\n‌[Pre-Chorus]‌\n（白檀木香）\n穿过种植基地的晨光，\n青苔记得每片叶子的生长。\n\n‌[Chorus]‌\n香遇尚坊，\n把森林的呼吸装进瓶罐。\n线香缭绕唐宋的月光，\n精油里藏着整片星空的璀璨。\n\n‌[Verse 2]‌\n工厂的玻璃墙过滤阳光，\n沉香木在匠人掌心苏醒。\n蒸馏塔里的晨昏，\n凝成琥珀色的诗行，\n梳齿间流淌着，\n银河的细浪。\n\n‌[Bridge]‌\n一百零八颗佛珠，\n一百零八个愿望，\n沉香木的温度，\n在脉搏里生长。\n\n‌[Outro]‌\n当香炉升起最后一缕烟，\n我们终将懂得——\n所有相遇，\n都是久别重逢的香缘。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [358.1386413574219, 324.63238525390625], "pos": [576.8812866210938, 581.0672607421875], "id": 1, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text"}, "order": 0}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-125.6286701173764, 3.6498789580445328], "scale": 0.8769226950000021}}, "groups": [{"color": "#8A8", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "suno音乐V5，0.5元一首，", "bounding": [553.8544311523438, 229.44964599609375, 1204.4139404296875, 80]}, {"color": "#A88", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "歌曲名称", "bounding": [659.24267578125, 351.43084716796875, 268.9485168457031, 157.7176971435547]}, {"color": "#A88", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "flac格式", "bounding": [1457.95947265625, 333.4129638671875, 297.557861328125, 202.62481689453125]}, {"color": "#A88", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "MP3格式", "bounding": [1458.024658203125, 561.4358520507812, 290, 219.60000610351562]}], "links": [[3, 5, 0, 6, 0, "AUDIO"], [5, 1, 0, 5, 1, "STRING"], [6, 11, 0, 5, 0, "STRING"], [7, 5, 0, 13, 0, "AUDIO"]], "id": "86e6d4a9-8a38-4153-9e21-83a53097704d", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 18, "revision": 0}